@artifactId = 5bc17996-e693-482c-b90d-7dd98c29019e

### Get artifact image URLs
GET {{host}}/api/v1/artifacts/{{artifactId}}/image-urls
Anonymous-User-UUID: {{userUuid}}

### Get artifact image URLs - invalid artifactId
GET {{host}}/api/v1/artifacts/not-an-artifact-id/image-urls
Anonymous-User-UUID: {{userUuid}}

### Get artifact image URLs - invalid user UUID
GET {{host}}/api/v1/artifacts/{{artifactId}}/image-urls
Anonymous-User-UUID: not-a-uuid
